# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Commit message guidelines
#
# Format
# type(scope): short description
#
# Example
# feat(shell): add SSH agent auto-detection
#
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Types
#
# feat      new feature
# fix       bug fix
# refactor  code change that does not change behavior
# docs      documentation changes
# chore     maintenance or configuration
# test      adding or updating tests
# style     formatting only (no code change)
#
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scopes used in this repository
#
# bootstrap   shell bootstrap and initialization
# shell       shell modules and environment
# ssh         SSH agent and signing configuration
# git         git configuration and tooling
# codex       Codex config and global guidance
# skills      reviewer skill definitions and learning policy
# ci          CI workflow checks
# release     release automation and git-cliff config
# test        smoke tests and validation helpers
# slides      Reveal.js slide templates and themes
# vscode      VS Code configuration
# repo        repository structure
# docs        documentation
#
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tips
#
# Use imperative mood
# Good: "add feature"
# Bad:  "added feature"
#
# Keep subject under ~72 characters.
#
# Body (optional)
# Explain WHY the change was made if not obvious.
#
# Footer (optional)
# Refs #<issue>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
